# Scratch directory — in-progress exploratory queries (see scripts/README.md —
# the scratch tier). Contents are throwaway; only this .gitignore is tracked,
# so the directory exists for new sessions. Lifecycle: an entry must be
# referenced from meta/BACKLOG.md / meta/roadmap.md or modified within the
# grace window — the scratch-hygiene pre-commit gate
# (scripts/tests/scratch-hygiene.sh) blocks the commit on anything else, so
# exploratory leftovers cannot outlive the work that made them.
*
!.gitignore
